{{- /*
  Cyclops welcome email template. Go html/template: everything outside {{ }} is plain HTML you
  can change freely. These comments produce no output.

  Cyclops sends this once per CertReport, the first time the report is set up (ADR 0015). It
  explains when cyclops emails and proves that mail delivery works. It does NOT list
  certificates: those arrive in the scheduled report's own email, even if both go out together.

  NOTHING here is required. The whole file is the email body, sent as one text/html part, so
  you may restructure, restyle or shorten it, or replace it entirely. What you cannot change:
    - the subject line (set by cyclops), and
    - the data available: only the fields below.

  Available data:
    .ReportName   the CertReport's name
    .GeneratedAt  when this email was generated (UTC)
    .Schedule     the report's cron schedule, evaluated in UTC (for example "0 8 * * *")
    .Namespaces   the namespaces the report covers; empty means every namespace, or, in
                  Ingress annotation mode, the Ingresses annotated for this report
    .Findings     the certificates that need attention right now (may be empty). The default
                  welcome email does not show them; they are here for custom templates.
  Referencing any other field fails the run and sends no email.

  Email clients ignore <style> blocks and scripts, so keep styling inline (style="...").
*/ -}}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
</head>
<body style="font-family: -apple-system, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #1f2328; margin: 0; padding: 24px;">
  <div style="background: #0c0e0d; margin: -24px -24px 20px; padding: 16px 24px;">{{/* Header band: the logo is attached to the email by cyclops (cid:cyclops-logo). Delete the div to drop it. */}}
    <img src="cid:cyclops-logo" alt="cyclops" width="300" style="display: block; border: 0;">
  </div>
  <h2 style="margin: 0 0 4px;">Welcome to Cyclops: {{ .ReportName }}</h2>
{{- if not .GeneratedAt.IsZero }}
  <p style="margin: 0 0 20px; color: #59636e; font-size: 13px;">Generated {{ .GeneratedAt.Format "2006-01-02 15:04 UTC" }}</p>
{{- end }}

  <p>This is a one-time message. It means cyclops is installed, and that it can send mail to this address.</p>

  <p style="margin-bottom: 4px;"><strong>When you will hear from cyclops</strong></p>
  <ul style="margin-top: 0; padding-left: 20px;">
    <li>A certificate has never been issued.</li>
    <li>A certificate has expired.</li>
    <li>A certificate is more than an hour past the renewal time cert-manager set for it.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>If none of these applies, cyclops sends nothing, so a quiet inbox means every certificate is fine.</p>

  <table style="border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 16px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 4px 16px 4px 0; color: #59636e;">Report</td>
      <td style="padding: 4px 0;">{{ .ReportName }}</td>
    </tr>
{{- if .Schedule }}
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 4px 16px 4px 0; color: #59636e;">Checks run</td>
      <td style="padding: 4px 0;"><code>{{ .Schedule }}</code> (UTC)</td>
    </tr>
{{- end }}
    <tr style="vertical-align: top;">
      <td style="padding: 4px 16px 4px 0; color: #59636e;">Covers</td>
      <td style="padding: 4px 0;">
        {{- if .Namespaces }}namespaces
          {{- range $i, $n := .Namespaces }}{{ if $i }},{{ end }} {{ $n }}{{ end }}
        {{- else }}every namespace, or the Ingresses annotated for this report{{ end -}}
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p style="margin-top: 24px; color: #59636e; font-size: 12px;">Sent by <a href="https://github.com/sakshitposting-irl/cyclops" style="font-weight: bold; color: #800425;">Cyclops</a>.</p>{{/* Footer. Safe to edit or remove. */}}
</body>
</html>
